# Copy to .dev.vars for local development. Never commit real credentials.
# Non-secret defaults are in wrangler.jsonc.

# Optional, Worker-side PR publishing only. Private cloning is not wired.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Optional, HMAC verification of acknowledgment-only GitHub webhooks.
# GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Optional Slack wiring. SLACK_APPROVERS empty means nobody can approve.
# SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET=
# SLACK_APPROVERS=
# SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=

# AI Gateway uses the AI binding and GATEWAY_ID, not a container provider key.
# Optional: sent as cf-aig-authorization on gateway requests (src/egress.ts).

